name: "echo-fleet"
displayName: "Echo Fleet"
author: "Dev - Blehhhh cat\nContributors - Kamikazefoxmk.i, Tinport, Aerodynamic Attorney \nMusic Composer - Ace1020spawn"
description:
'''
This mod adds 2 planets sharing a single campaign to the game. 

You [stat]WILL[] be forced to work with excruciatingly hideous structures that output 4 different liquids and require gigantic factory setups to just run. yes. 

The mod is still wip. 
Only 5 sectors are done as of now.
'''
subtitle: blehhhh
minGameVersion: 156.2
repo: BSp-2/Echo-fleet


